./orchestration/tickets/T15-day-review/plan.md:486:1. **`PLAN_FAKE_NOW` = the REAL current local date at T12:00:00** — `datetime.now().astimezone().date().isoformat() + "T12:00:00"`. Reason: `seed_demo` computes "today" from `datetime.now()` (demo.py:30), so fake-now must share that calendar date for `/api/day/today` (planning date of fake noon = that date, §6.1) to hit the demo day. Noon is safe at any real run time: planning date at 12:00 is always the calendar date.
